  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/timers-and-user-prompts.html#timer-initialisation-steps\r\n\r\n> 1. Let thisArg be global if that is a [WorkerGlobalScope](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#workerglobalscope) object; otherwise let thisArg be the [WindowProxy](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#windowproxy) that corresponds to global.\r\n\r\nShould this go through *thisArg*'s [browsing context](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#window-bc) and check if that is null?",
